							Kinsonn, let me put it this way.<br /><br />You train my wife, and every zone you step foot in you will have atleast 10 mobs sitting ontop of you.<br /><br />You need to watch your mouth, or your officers need to watch it for you. &nbsp;You sure do talk a lot of trash to people far above you.<br /><br />As a suggestion, I would say the best thing you could do right about now is just stop posting, stop being a dumbass, and try not to make attacks against people with far more connections than you.
