								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Can&#039;t think of an intelligent insult, so you just throw random masses of profane words together hoping it gets your point across, eh Garadan?<br /><br />And guild politics...ahahahaha. As Garadan doesn&#039;t know, I doubt the rest of you &quot;uber guild&quot; folks do. There is a *HUGE* difference between &quot;uber guilds&quot; and casual guilds. I&#039;m not in this guild for loot, I&#039;m not in in to be the best, I&#039;m in it because this is where my friends are. If I wanted time loot, I could go join my brother who&#039;s an officer in DA. I&#039;ve known most of the people in my guild 4 - 5 years, unlike &quot;uber guilds&quot; who constantly gain and lose members. Good luck getting me kicked, fool.<br /><br />..And what are you going to do Ssnakes, cyber a GM to see through /role for you?
						</td>
					</tr>
